# 来源(4 路交叉验证):
#   1. 本机应用二进制字符串提取 —— Parallels Desktop 20.4.1
#      /Applications/Parallels Desktop.app (prl_client_app, prl_disp_service, prl_updater_ctl)
#      实测命中: account / desktop / kb / link / my / reports / reportus / static / support /
#                update / www.parallels.com / www.parallels.cn / com.parallels.de
#      本机配置文件命中的接口: https://pax-manager.myparallels.com/xmlrpc/rpc.do
